# Send only what "dotnet restore" and "dotnet publish" need to the build
# context: the project file, the C# files, the settings, and the page.
# Anything else (.git, manifests, docs) would bloat the images and
# invalidate the build cache on every unrelated change.
*
!*.csproj
!**/*.cs
!appsettings*.json
!wwwroot
**/bin/**
**/obj/**
tests/**
